# Schedule D (Form 1040)

{% subtitle %}Capital Gains and Losses{% /subtitle %}

{% section %}
## Part I. Short-Term Capital Gains and Losses—Generally Assets Held One Year or Less (see instructions)

{% columns %}
- {% column index="(d)" %}
  {% instructions %}Proceeds (sales price){% /instructions %}
  {% /column %}
- {% column index="(e)" %}
  {% instructions %}Cost (or other basis){% /instructions %}
  {% /column %}
- {% column index="(g)" %}
  {% instructions %}Adjustments to gain or loss from Form(s) 8949, Part I, line 2, column (g){% /instructions %}
  {% /column %}
- {% column index="(h)" %}
  {% instructions %}Gain or (loss). Subtract column (e) from column (d) and combine the result with column (g){% /instructions %}
  {% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% lines %}
- {% line index="1a" %}
  - {% instructions %}Totals for all short-term transactions reported on Form 1099-B or Form 1099-DA for which basis was reported to the IRS and for which you have no adjustments (see instructions). However, if you choose to report all these transactions on Form 8949, leave this line blank and go to line 1b{% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="1a(d)" column="(d)" %}
    {% value type="select_instance_boxes_input" %}
    - {% option form="f1099B" box="1d" /%}
    {% /value %}
    {% /box %}
  - {% box identifier="1a(e)" column="(e)" %}
    {% value type="select_instance_boxes_input" %}
    - {% option form="f1099B" box="1e" /%}
    {% /value %}
    {% /box %}
  - {% box identifier="1a(g)" column="(g)" %}{% value type="unused" /%}{% /box %}
  - {% box identifier="1a(h)" column="(h)" %}
    {% value type="sum" %}
    - {% value type="difference" %}
