{% section %}
## Part I (continued)

{% lines %}
- {% line index="4" %}
  - {% instructions %}Short-term gain from Form 6252 and short-term gain or (loss) from Forms 4684, 6781, and 8824{% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="4" %}{% value type="number_input" /%}{% /box %}
  {% /line %}
- {% line index="5" %}
  - {% instructions %}Net short-term gain or (loss) from partnerships, S corporations, estates, and trusts from Schedule(s) K-1{% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="5" %}{% value type="number_input" /%}{% /box %}
  {% /line %}
- {% line index="6" %}
  - {% instructions %}Short-term capital loss carryover. Enter the amount, if any, from line 8 of your Capital Loss Carryover Worksheet in the instructions{% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="6" %}{% value type="number_input" coerceSign="negative" /%}{% /box %}
  {% /line %}
- {% line index="7" %}
  - {% instructions %}**Net short-term capital gain or (loss).** Combine lines 1a through 6 in column (h). If you have any long-term capital gains or losses, go to Part II below. Otherwise, go to Part III on the back{% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="7" %}
    {% value type="sum" %}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="1a(h)" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="1b(h)" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="2(h)" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="3(h)" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="4" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="5" /%}
    - {% value type="box_reference" box="6" /%}
    {% /value %}
    {% /box %}
  {% /line %}
{% /lines %}
{% /section %}

